# NFTTiX Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit reports completed by Softstack for NFTTiX.

NFTTiX is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as an NFT ticketing, event factory and marketplace smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: NFTTiX  
Audit type: NFT ticketing, event factory and marketplace smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

